    "updated_at": "2023-02-25T17:15:14Z",
    "body": "This issue is more that the behavior specified doesn't match. Which one are browsers supposed to implement?\r\n\r\nHTML spec:\r\n> If options's crossorigin is not Anonymous\r\n\r\nvs. resource hints:\r\n> If corsAttributeState is Anonymous\r\n\r\nWebKit currently implements the latter:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/c88d60bba87882ae273efc96423f221933cb373d",
    "author_association": "NONE",
